{'symbol': 'SHW', 'date': '2022-12-16 16:05:00', 'title': 'ULTA BEAUTY ANNOUNCES ADDITION TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'BOLINGBROOK, ILL.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--ULTA BEAUTY, INC. (NASDAQ: ULTA) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT HEIDI G. PETZ, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER OF THE SHERWIN-WILLIAMS COMPANY (NYSE: SHW), HAS BEEN ELECTED TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 16, 2022.'}